lse,\"options\":[\"(Recommended) Re-run both Alpine (Stages 1–3) and Ubuntu Heavy (Test 1 + Stage 3) with the new CPU/RAM sampler so all thesis plots have complete, matching data\",\"Keep the existing Alpine timings and only run the new CPU/RAM sampler on Ubuntu Heavy (plus a quick Alpine Stage 3 re-run)\",\"Only run Ubuntu Heavy for now, and decide on re-running Alpine afterward\"],\"question\":\"Since the previous Alpine run only took post-barrier RAM snapshots (after verify clones were already destroyed) and had no CPU tracking, how would you like to handle the datasets?\"}]","toolAction":"\"Asking user about CPU and RAM telemetry design\"","toolSummary":"\"Clarify CPU/RAM metrics and dataset re-run scope\""}}]}
